--     hcomp, twoH, Phi, H4, Over.Unloop, the integers (add, addP, sucZ, zeroZ, neg,
--     negPos: pos (n+1) = pos n + 1 and negsuc n = neg (pos (n+1)) by definition),
--     rho / rhoZ / rhoN / not / xor (factor: g (rho 1) = h 1), Quot.inc / image
